#: templates/default/list_views.html:9
msgid ""
"Views serve different zone variants to different clients based on the "
"network that queried the resolver. Each variant is named zone..variant (for "
"example, example.com..trusted) and must exist as a separate zone in PowerDNS "
"before it can be assigned here. Variants share a name but resolve "
"differently per view, so the same hostname can answer with different IPs "
"depending on the client's network."
msgstr ""
"Skati piegādā dažādiem klientiem dažādus zonas variantus atkarībā no tīkla, "
"no kura tika veikts vaicājums atrisinātājam. Katrs variants tiek nosaukts "
"formā zone..variant (piemēram, example.com..trusted), un pirms piešķiršanas "
"šeit tam PowerDNS jāpastāv kā atsevišķai zonai. Varianti dala vienu "
"nosaukumu, bet katrā skatā atrisinās atšķirīgi, tāpēc viens un tas pats "
"resursdatora nosaukums var atbildēt ar dažādām IP adresēm atkarībā no "
"klienta tīkla."

